    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deathrun</strong> is a fun and exciting multiplayer game where you race through obstacle-filled courses in a battle-royale-style challenge! In this dynamic, cartoonish game, you must overcome deadly traps, dodge hazards, and outrun your opponents to be the last one standing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built on Unreal Engine 5, <strong>Deathrun</strong> offers smooth animations and a vibrant visual style. With P2P network architecture, you can compete with friends and players worldwide, enjoying fast and stable matches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into wild challenges, customize your character with a variety of outfits and accessories, and prove that you have what it takes to become the champion!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cartoonish graphics on Unreal Engine 5</strong>: A bright and stylish visual world where every challenge looks amazing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>P2P multiplayer</strong>: Engage in low-latency matches no matter where you or your opponents are.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character customization</strong>: Create your own unique look with tons of costume and accessory options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exciting levels</strong>: Each arena is full of dynamic traps that will keep you on edge from start to finish.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Regular updates</strong>: New levels, game modes, and cosmetic items are constantly added.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to race through deadly obstacles and become the best of the best? Join us in <strong>Deathrun</strong> and show what you\u2019re made of!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deathrun</strong> is a fun and exciting multiplayer game where you race through obstacle-filled courses in a battle-royale-style challenge! In this dynamic, cartoonish game, you must overcome deadly traps, dodge hazards, and outrun your opponents to be the last one standing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built on Unreal Engine 5, <strong>Deathrun</strong> offers smooth animations and a vibrant visual style. With P2P network architecture, you can compete with friends and players worldwide, enjoying fast and stable matches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into wild challenges, customize your character with a variety of outfits and accessories, and prove that you have what it takes to become the champion!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cartoonish graphics on Unreal Engine 5</strong>: A bright and stylish visual world where every challenge looks amazing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>P2P multiplayer</strong>: Engage in low-latency matches no matter where you or your opponents are.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character customization</strong>: Create your own unique look with tons of costume and accessory options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exciting levels</strong>: Each arena is full of dynamic traps that will keep you on edge from start to finish.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Regular updates</strong>: New levels, game modes, and cosmetic items are constantly added.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to race through deadly obstacles and become the best of the best? Join us in <strong>Deathrun</strong> and show what you\u2019re made of!</p>",
